* B1_conventional_ota, testbench B_tr
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* Unity-gain follower, +/-0.2 V step, CL = 2 pF behind Rs. Slew = 20-80 % slope of V(oL) (the load capacitor).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 0.45
Vss vss 0 -0.45
Ib vdd nb 2.5u
Mb nb nb vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M0 t nb vss vss nmos90 W=20u L=180n
M1 a inn t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M2 b inp t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M3 a a vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4 b b vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M3P out b vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4P c a vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M5 c c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M6 out c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
Vml out oL 0
Cl oL 0 2p
Vin inp 0 PULSE(-0.2 0.2 20n 1n 1n 399n 800n)
Vsh inn out 0
.tran 0 900n 0 0.2n
.meas TRAN t_r20 WHEN V(oL)=-0.12 RISE=1
.meas TRAN t_r80 WHEN V(oL)=0.12 RISE=1
.meas TRAN sr_rise_V_per_us PARAM 0.24/(t_r80-t_r20)/1e6
.meas TRAN t_f80 WHEN V(oL)=0.12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN t_f20 WHEN V(oL)=-0.12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN sr_fall_V_per_us PARAM -0.24/(t_f20-t_f80)/1e6
.backanno
.end
